@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Forehand to backhand volleys
Forehand to backhand volleys, three minutes. In the middle, two metres from the front wall: forehand
across to your backhand, backhand back across, hitting around the service line just off centre. Let
it bounce for the first half. Phase two target: twenty volleys in one rally, without a break.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
8% Short swings. Racket up early.
50% Now on the volley. Target: twenty without a break. Lose it? Restart with a bounce, and count from zero.
78% Keep the rhythm. Watch the ball.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
